  "content": "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">V14 釋出！<br>- 教學地圖已重製為更線性的教學玩法，希望能以更易懂的概念呈現，並加入幾個戰鬥區域</h3>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>（本次更新新增的模組以藍色標示）</strong></span></p>\n<h1><strong>1. 槍械包</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>本整合包將科幻或無法自訂的武器數量降至最低。這並不意味著所有武器都會完全寫實或可自訂，但這裡約有 400 種獨特武器。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>本整合包充滿了虛構槍枝與重複槍型。請使用右側的「Just Enough Items (JEI)」物品查詢功能，瀏覽我精心挑選、僅限寫實且獨一無二的槍枝清單。</strong></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong>槍枝模組列表如下：&nbsp;</strong></em></span></h2>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#fff\">- [ 模組名稱 ] - [ 作者名稱 ] - <strong><em>[ 授權條款 ]</em></strong></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">[ 於 v13.5 刪除 ] -&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superb-warfare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[SBW] Superb Warfare</a> - Mercurows <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>推薦！</strong></span></span></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">[ 於 v13.5 刪除 ] - <a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcsp-military-vehicle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[SBW] MCSP - ADDON</a> - Tornqvista <strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">&nbsp;推薦！</span></strong></span></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><em><strong>- </strong></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-addons-daffas-arsenal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[TACZ Addons] Daffa's Arsenal</a> - dafafatan </span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[ 自訂授權 ]</strong></em></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-</span> </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maxstuff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"